    featuredImagePrompt: "A close-up, high-angle shot of a sleek, futuristic, and subtly aggressive defense drone or autonomous vehicle, rendered with clean lines and advanced materials, taking prominence in the foreground. In the slightly blurred background, a digital financial report screen is visible, displaying a stark red bar chart and negative figures, with the faint silhouette of a rocket, representing the recent SpaceX IPO earnings. The drone's design should evoke innovation and high-tech investment, contrasting with the financial difficulties implied by the background screen. The overall atmosphere should be one of cutting-edge technology and shifting economic tides in the tech investment landscape. Use a cool color palette with highlights of glowing tech elements on the drone, with a touch of deep blue and crimson in the background screen to emphasize the financial data. The composition should clearly differentiate the thriving defense tech from the struggling aerospace finances.",
