    featuredImagePrompt: "An editorial news layout featuring a split image. On one side, a distressed, abstract digital globe with subtle red geopolitical heatmaps, symbolizing global tensions and market volatility, with faint digital currency symbols (Bitcoin, Ethereum) in the background. On the other side, a clean, professional image of the Charles Schwab logo subtly integrated with abstract financial charts and digital lines, representing institutional entry into crypto spot trading. The overall composition should be dynamic, conveying both conflict and progress in the financial world, with a sophisticated, news-report aesthetic. Focus on clarity and visual impact for a news feed, avoiding generic stock imagery.",
