    featuredImagePrompt: "A conceptual, dynamic image depicting the fusion of space exploration and financial growth. A sleek, futuristic rocket is launching from a stylized launchpad, its exhaust trail transforming into upward-trending financial charts and digital currency symbols. The rocket is angled towards a starry galaxy, with a subtle, glowing Earth visible in the background. The overall aesthetic is vibrant and aspirational, using deep blues, purples, and golden highlights to signify ambition and wealth. The composition should convey both technological advancement and significant financial opportunity, avoiding any literal depiction of a stock market floor or a generic rocket. The visual style should be sleek, modern, and high-tech, emphasizing the 'trillion-dollar trajectory' concept. This image should have a unique perspective and composition, different from previous data-driven or literal space visuals, offering a fresh conceptual take.",
