      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There\'s a moderate probability (50%) of DogeOS gaining some traction as a niche DeFi platform, offering new utility for DOGE, but a lower probability (20%) of it becoming a major DeFi player. The MetaMask incident, while a concern, has a high probability (70%) of being a short-term issue with minimal lasting impact on overall Ethereum staking, assuming continued transparency and security enhancements. The regulatory environment (MSCI) poses a persistent, medium-term risk (40% probability of negative impact on specific equities).",
