      bearCase: "The CFTC rejects Coinbase\'s filing, or imposes overly restrictive conditions, making the product unviable. This results in wasted development costs, delays in diversification, and a potential blow to Coinbase\'s innovation narrative. Competition from traditional brokers or other crypto exchanges could also quickly emerge if approval is granted, eroding market share.",
