      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "A 50% probability of eventual approval with some modifications, a 30% probability of significant delays or rejection, and a 20% probability of swift, full approval. The probability of success is weighted towards a cautious optimism given the innovative nature and regulatory complexities, but the strategic intent is strong.",
